{"title":"Career Roadmap · Digital Marketing Executive","role":"Digital Marketing Executive","summary":"A Digital Marketing Executive plans, executes, monitors and optimizes digital marketing campaigns across search engines, social media, websites, email and digital advertising platforms.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Digital Marketing Executive plans, executes, monitors and optimizes digital marketing campaigns across search engines, social media, websites, email and digital advertising platforms."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Social media marketing"},{"text":"Paid advertising"},{"text":"Content marketing"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Website analytics"},{"text":"Conversion optimization"},{"text":"Lead generation"},{"text":"E-commerce marketing"},{"text":"Campaign reporting"},{"text":"Customer acquisition"},{"text":"Marketing automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A BCA with Digital Marketing / E-Commerce provides a useful combination of technology + marketing + digital business. This can be especially valuable for roles where marketing teams work closely with websites, analytics, CRM systems and e-commerce platforms."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Typical Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Undergraduate"},{"text":"Digital marketing + analytics + e-commerce"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Executive / SEO/PPC Executive"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"Digital Marketing Manager / Growth Marketer"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Growth / Digital Marketing Head / Marketing Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During BCA","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills","Proof of Progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Marketing foundations"},{"text":"Digital marketing, consumer behaviour, content"},{"text":"Marketing case studies"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"SEO, social media, paid advertising"},{"text":"Campaign projects"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Analytics & e-commerce"},{"text":"GA4, conversion optimization, CRM"},{"text":"E-commerce growth project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional marketing"},{"text":"Performance marketing, automation, strategy"},{"text":"Internship + marketing portfolio"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"For a 3-year BCA, incorporate the final-year topics into the last year."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Marketing Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how digital businesses acquire and retain customers."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Marketing fundamentals"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Branding"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Digital channels"},{"text":"Market research"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Content strategy"},{"text":"Copywriting"},{"text":"Basic design"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Customer funnel"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Awareness","Interest","Consideration","Conversion","Retention","Advocacy"]},{"type":"p","text":"Every marketing campaign should have a clear position in this funnel."}]},{"heading":"Website & Web Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The BCA background provides an advantage here."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML"},{"text":"CSS"},{"text":"Basic JavaScript"},{"text":"Website structure"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Responsive design"},{"text":"CMS concepts"},{"text":"WordPress"},{"text":"E-commerce platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"URLs"},{"text":"Metadata"},{"text":"Page speed"},{"text":"Mobile responsiveness"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Tracking codes"},{"text":"Conversion elements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A marketer who understands how websites actually work can collaborate much more effectively with developers."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Search Engine Optimisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"SEO should be a major skill."},{"type":"h","text":"On-page SEO"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Search intent"},{"text":"Title tags"},{"text":"Meta descriptions"},{"text":"Headings"},{"text":"Internal linking"},{"text":"Content structure"},{"text":"Image optimization"},{"text":"Schema basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical SEO"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Crawling"},{"text":"Indexing"},{"text":"Robots.txt"},{"text":"XML sitemaps"},{"text":"Canonical tags"},{"text":"Redirects"},{"text":"Structured data"},{"text":"Core Web Vitals"},{"text":"Mobile usability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Off-page SEO"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Backlinks"},{"text":"Digital PR"},{"text":"Authority building"},{"text":"Content distribution"}]}]},{"heading":"Paid Advertising","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the fundamentals of performance marketing."},{"type":"h","text":"Search advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword targeting"},{"text":"Search campaigns"},{"text":"Ad copy"},{"text":"Bidding"},{"text":"Quality/relevance"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Social advertising"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audience targeting"},{"text":"Campaign objectives"},{"text":"Creative testing"},{"text":"Retargeting"},{"text":"Lookalike/similar audiences"},{"text":"Budget allocation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Major platforms include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Ads"},{"text":"Meta Ads"},{"text":"LinkedIn Ads"},{"text":"YouTube advertising"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Platform interfaces change frequently, so students should focus on campaign principles and measurement, not memorizing one platform's interface."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Analytics is one of the strongest career differentiators."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Google Analytics 4"},{"text":"Google Search Console"},{"text":"Looker Studio"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"UTM parameters"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important metrics"},{"type":"h","text":"Acquisition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Impressions"},{"text":"Reach"},{"text":"Clicks"},{"text":"CTR"},{"text":"CPC"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Conversion"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"Cost per lead"},{"text":"Cost per acquisition"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"ROAS"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Retention"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Repeat purchase rate"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Engagement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not optimize campaigns only for clicks. Connect marketing activity to business outcomes."}]},{"heading":"E-Commerce Marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Because the degree includes E-Commerce, learn the complete online-sales funnel."},{"type":"h","text":"E-commerce workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Traffic","Product Page","Add to Cart","Checkout","Purchase","Repeat Purchase"]},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product-page optimization"},{"text":"Search/filter systems"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Cart abandonment"},{"text":"Checkout optimization"},{"text":"Reviews"},{"text":"Product recommendations"},{"text":"Email remarketing"},{"text":"Customer retention"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Useful platforms"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand at least one:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Shopify"},{"text":"WooCommerce"},{"text":"Magento/Adobe Commerce"}]}]},{"heading":"Content Marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn to create content for different channels."},{"type":"h","text":"Content types"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Blog posts"},{"text":"Social posts"},{"text":"Short videos"},{"text":"Reels"},{"text":"Infographics"},{"text":"Email newsletters"},{"text":"Product pages"},{"text":"Case studies"},{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"Guides"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Important skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Copywriting"},{"text":"Storytelling"},{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"CTA design"},{"text":"Content planning"},{"text":"SEO writing"},{"text":"Audience research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can accelerate content production, but marketers still need to provide strategy, fact-checking, positioning and quality control."}]},{"heading":"Social Media Marketing","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand platform-specific behaviour."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content calendars"},{"text":"Audience research"},{"text":"Community management"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Hashtag/keyword strategy"},{"text":"Social analytics"},{"text":"Influencer marketing"},{"text":"Short-form video"},{"text":"Social listening"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective should not simply be:"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Get more followers.\""},{"type":"p","text":"Instead measure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reach","Engagement","Traffic","Leads","Revenue"]}]},{"heading":"Email & Marketing Automation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Email campaigns"},{"text":"Segmentation"},{"text":"Personalization"},{"text":"Drip campaigns"},{"text":"Lead nurturing"},{"text":"Abandoned-cart campaigns"},{"text":"Welcome sequences"},{"text":"Re-engagement campaigns"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand basic CRM concepts:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"Prospects"},{"text":"Customers"},{"text":"Lifecycle stages"},{"text":"Lead scoring"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful platforms include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HubSpot"},{"text":"Mailchimp"},{"text":"Klaviyo"},{"text":"Salesforce Marketing tools"}]}]},{"heading":"Conversion Rate Optimization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"CRO is a valuable advanced skill."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to improve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Landing pages"},{"text":"CTAs"},{"text":"Forms"},{"text":"Product pages"},{"text":"Checkout"},{"text":"Navigation"},{"text":"Page speed"},{"text":"Trust signals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"A/B testing"},{"type":"p","text":"Test variables such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headlines"},{"text":"Images"},{"text":"CTA text"},{"text":"Form length"},{"text":"Pricing presentation"},{"text":"Page layout"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Hypothesis","Test","Measure","Analyse","Implement"]}]},{"heading":"Build a Marketing Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Digital Marketing candidate should not rely only on a resume."},{"type":"p","text":"Create measurable projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — SEO Website"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a niche website and document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Keyword research"},{"text":"Content strategy"},{"text":"Technical SEO"},{"text":"Traffic growth"},{"text":"Search performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Paid Advertising Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a campaign plan with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Target audience"},{"text":"Campaign objective"},{"text":"Budget"},{"text":"Ad creatives"},{"text":"Keywords"},{"text":"Landing page"},{"text":"Conversion goal"},{"text":"KPI framework"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — E-Commerce Store"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Shopify/WooCommerce store and demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product pages"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Conversion tracking"},{"text":"Email marketing"},{"text":"Abandoned-cart strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Social Media Campaign"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a 30-day campaign including:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Content calendar"},{"text":"Short-form videos"},{"text":"Creative strategy"},{"text":"Engagement strategy"},{"text":"Analytics report"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Marketing Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Traffic"},{"text":"Leads"},{"text":"Conversion rate"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"ROAS"},{"text":"Channel performance"}]}]},{"heading":"Final-Year Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build an E-Commerce Growth Analytics Platform."},{"type":"h","text":"Example architecture"},{"type":"flow","items":["Website","Analytics","Marketing Channels","Database","Dashboard"]},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Visitors"},{"text":"Product views"},{"text":"Cart additions"},{"text":"Purchases"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Campaign source"},{"text":"Customer segments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HTML/CSS/JS"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Excel/Power BI or Looker Studio"},{"text":"Analytics tools"},{"text":"E-commerce platform"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This uses the student's BCA background rather than treating digital marketing as purely a content career."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital marketing agencies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Startups"},{"text":"Advertising agencies"},{"text":"D2C brands"},{"text":"EdTech companies"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"Marketing technology companies"},{"text":"Media companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relevant internships"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Marketing Intern"},{"text":"SEO Intern"},{"text":"Performance Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Social Media Marketing Intern"},{"tex